er-changing sky. Infinity Flight VR combines the addictive rhythm of an infinity runner with the immersive power of virtual reality.\n\nEngineered for a silky-smooth flight experience on Meta Quest, the game features a refined locomotion system that minimizes motion sickness while maximizing the thrill of high-speed maneuvers. You aren't just playing a game; you are mastering the air.", "short_description": "Infinity Flight VR\n\nTake to the skies in the ultimate VR endless flyer! Pilot your aircraft with ultra-smooth locomotion as you weave through a relentless gauntlet of moving obstacles. Test your reflexes in a high-stakes infinity runner designed specifically for Meta Quest. How long can you survive the slipstream?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.georgegamesnation.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jorge Poveda", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://georgegamesnation.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25205331642473607"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25487956270877808", "version": 